# OS and editor droppings. This account works across two Windows laptops and a
# Mac (see workstation/BOOTSTRAP.md), so both families can land in any repo -
# .DS_Store from the Mac, Thumbs.db and desktop.ini from Windows. Whichever
# machine commits first is the one that inflicts them on the other two.
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editor scratch
*.swp
*~

# Secrets: never commit these. Added in the 2026-09-10 audit, which found
# several repos had no .env coverage at all.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
